PASS  forms: typed values and ticks are kept in the saved PDF; checkbox tick shows
PASS  pages: rotate, move, duplicate, delete, insert blank; saved PDF follows
PASS  signature: drawn once, kept for next time, placed as a picture in the PDF
PASS  library: an opened PDF and its mark-up come back after a reload
PASS  extract pages: parses ranges
PASS  phone: the page fits the screen, the sidebar is out of the way, nothing scrolls sideways
PASS  dark pages and themes
